{"resourceIdentifier":"1759","resourceName":"Methane Recovery and Power Generation Project at ESIPL","description":"The ESPIL has installed thermophilic biomethanation reactor based on anaerobic methanation process for treatment of effulent. The effluent is subsequently sent to the storage tank where the Biomethanation plant has been generating biogas, which is being utilized for generating power in DG set for meeting captive consumption. By extracting and capturing methane enriched biogas in the anaerobic digester the project reduces CH4 emission that would have otherwise emitted from the existing open lagoon system in the absence of the project activity. ESIPL has commissioned Jenbacher 1x JGS 320 GS BL generating set supplied by Clarke Energy producing power equivalent to 1067 kW, with output 450V, unity power factor at 50 Hz. The project activity will generate approximately 8000MWh annually.  This project was open for public comment from 4 May - 3 June 2018. No comments were received.","location":{"latitude":22.483889,"longitude":71.281389},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1759"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gujarat"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Everest Starch India Pvt. Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Gujarat, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1759"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"52036"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.F.,AMS-III.H."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"KBS Certification Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT